			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance all submodules to latest upstream revisions\n\nBatch update across all Element submodules to synchronize with upstream.\n\nMountain introduces a stable workspace identifier based on configuration path or folder URI, completes the CreateEffectForRequest refactoring with Matches pre-filters and parameter borrowing to reduce clone overhead on the hot dispatch path, and fixes an ActiveOperations leak on RPC cancellation in addition to Vine filesystem corrections for WriteFile byte-array decoding and Stat empty-path ordering.\n\nWind fixes SCM duplicate registration by ensuring ResolveConfiguration excludes folderUri when workspace is present.\n\nCocoon regenerates RouteManifest to include FileWatcher.Unwatch, FileWatcher.Watch, and FileWatcher.WatchStatus methods and rebuilds compiled artifacts across bootstrap, effect, service, handler, gRPC, and dual-track layers.\n\nAll remaining submodules advance with minor formatting normalizations and CI dependency bumps.",
